      "content": "it's so much to take in. i never thought of it as a \"gift\" before, i just thought i was being weird or obsessive. but when you say it's about being a bridge, it makes me think about why i feel so much more drawn to the idea of space and colonizing mars than anything else on earth. like, i feel this magnetic pull toward it, almost like a physical sensation in my chest when i see news about the red planet. \n\nif i'm supposed to be a leader for what's coming, how do i even start? like, how do i prepare myself when i'm stuck here in this normal, everyday life while waiting for this \"next cycle\" to actually happen?",
      "source": "evaluator"
